    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d819">

                <pb facs="1034" n="938" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg938"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Personal.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The instruction sent to-day about Philippines has the cordial concurrence of the
                    seven members of Cabinet now in Washington, Long being absent in Massachusetts.
                    Gage has written you in the same sense. Let me add your course has the warm
                    approval of us all.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
